  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "blk_3a4e2250",
      "type": "text_title",
      "text": "《文明纪实·拉海洛》节选一",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 1,
        "source_type": "文本标题",
        "source_row": 2,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_3fdbd293",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "……",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 2,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 3,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_34fec132",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "这一天，先行公约的科考团首次踏足了这片冰面上的土地，并首次发现了在冰原上引导着隧群回归隧者的罗伊族。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 3,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 4,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_8d38c820",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "科考团看着眼前这些“牧人”一般的罗伊族，神情难掩激动，他们将拉海洛视作现代最伟大的发现之一。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 4,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 5,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_958ab789",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "与与此同时，与外界隔绝了不知多少代人的罗伊人也打量着这些奇装异服的外来客，萌生了对拉海洛以外世界的好奇。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 5,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 6,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_c6741800",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "……",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 6,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 7,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_2283f97d",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "在返航途中，科考团团长便撰写出了一篇关于拉海洛的报道，从行文的每一处都流露出他激动与惊喜，她断定自己即将将要成为名留史册的传奇科考专家。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 7,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 8,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_89f3f884",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "“在遥远的极地上，存在着一个与世隔绝的奇异文明，他们是一支历史悠久原始部族，生活在极地冰盖之下的广袤世界，其服饰与现代人截然不同……他们懂得放牧，但牧群竟然是机械的牛羊，甚至还有机械的巨象……”",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 8,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 9,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_bf6a030b",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "然而，当这篇传奇报道发回先约总部后，事情的发展却出乎了所有科考队员的预料。他们没有被大肆宣传，没有成为闻名遐迩的冒险家——实际上，他们在抵达总部后受到了严格的监督管控。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 9,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 10,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_5d7567ad",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "彼时的先行公约高层认为，这一“轰动的消息”或许将引发难以预计的骚乱。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 10,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 11,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_a33a082c",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "最终，先行公约封锁了与拉海洛相关的信息——这只科考队的一切都如同不曾存在过一样。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 11,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 12,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_33e32918",
      "type": "text_title",
      "text": "《文明纪实·拉海洛》（节选二）",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 13,
        "source_type": "文本标题",
        "source_row": 14,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_13d27859",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "然而，如此重大的发现要完全保密几乎是不可能的事。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 14,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 15,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_b6ec0354",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "有部分机构突破消息封锁，获得了来自内线的情报，并开始私自派遣调查团登陆拉海洛，试图抢先占有“新大陆”的发现成果。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 15,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 16,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_090d119c",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "部分自诩来自「文明世界」的人，将罗伊族视作落后的部族，并不打算以文明世界的准则对待他们。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 16,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 17,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_17887d96",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "他们向罗伊人提供外部世界中寻常不过的物资、甚至已被时代淘汰的的科技产物，试图用廉价的手段换得罗伊人的信任与感恩。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 17,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 18,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_8537291d",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "然而大部分罗伊人并不会为之所动，他们有选择地隐瞒了关于隧者的关键信息，配合扮演着“落后部族”的形象，实际上则暗中辨明着各势力的真实目的。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 18,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 19,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_78d32fc2",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "……",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 19,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 20,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_0f1f54af",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "在各国商讨建设「极地联合」的会议上，一名「昭日者」的出现，彻底扭转了闻名世界对于罗伊族的看法（编者注：关于此事的详细记载可见《罗伊算式抄卷·序一》）。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 20,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 21,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_0fc71e79",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "最终，罗伊族不仅保全了自身，还令外界认识到了若要探索拉海洛，若要研究隧者与隧群，一定离不开他们的协助。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 21,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 22,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_b9f051cd",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "……",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 22,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 23,
        "xlsx_section_index": 1
      }
    }
  ]
}